WEBVTT

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:26.700
My father's no different than any other powerful man who's responsible for other people.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.700
I had this part in a picture. It'd put me right back on top again.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.500
This Hollywood big shot's gonna give you what you want.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:40.800
He says there's no chance.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.500
I'm gonna make him an offer he can't refuse.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.800
You know my father. Men are coming here to kill him.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.100
Now you want to get mixed up in the family business?

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.600
I thought you weren't going to become a man like your father.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.800
I never wanted this for you.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:09.200
Fredo, you're my older brother and I love you.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:12.500
But don't ever take sides with anyone against the family again.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:21.700
Do you renounce Satan and all his works?

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.100
I do renounce him.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:27.900
Don't ask me about my business, Kay.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:28.800
Is it true?

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:42.600
Leave the gun. Take the cannoli.
